# Every text file is checked out with LF, also on Windows (core.autocrlf=true). The scripts a Jarvis
# copies from templates/ must stay byte-identical to the canonical copy (validator sweeps 14-16),
# and bash refuses CRLF scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
